Implement move role/selected to outer, radius, padding. Need adjust `list_row` removes role? We'll do in Sidebar:
```rust
let mut row = list_row(...);
row.properties.remove(&property_id::ROLE);
row.properties.remove(&property_id::SELECTED);
CornerRadius(Length::token("control.radius")).apply(&mut row);
let mut outer = plain_node(Component::VStack, vec![row], BTreeMap::new());
outer.properties.insert(PADDING_TOP, LIST_SIDEBAR_ROW_GAP_OUTER.to_bits());
outer.properties.insert(PADDING_BOTTOM, ...);
outer.properties.insert(WIDTH, size::FILL.to_bits());
outer.properties.insert(SELECTED, u32::from(config.selected));
outer.properties.insert(ROLE, LIST_ITEM);
outer
```
Should the outer VStack be fill width? set WIDTH FILL. Good. Could apply `CornerRadius` to inner; default radius token. `CornerRadius` imported/ public. `Length::token` in scope. Good.
- Should move `SELECTED` from inner even if inner is row+separator? Sidebar no separators. Fine.
- `list_row` sets role and selected. Remove from inner.
- `ROLE` uses pathland_core::role::LIST_ITEM.
Let's edit.

